/target
# Build product staged by dist-lean/build.sh so cargo-dist can find the
# declared binary next to dist-lean/dist.toml; never commit the binary itself.
/dist-lean/hippius-mem
# macOS Finder metadata; never relevant to the repo.
.DS_Store
# Local model cache written by fastembed under the `embeddings` feature
# (bge-small-en-v1.5 by default, ~130 MB). Downloaded on demand; never commit it.
.fastembed_cache/
# Minted S3 sub-token credentials written by `hippius-mem mint-token`; contains
# a secret and must never be committed.
/hippius-mem-subtoken.toml
# Live server config: holds the S3 sub-token secret, team key, and author seed.
/hippius-mem.toml
# Local hook state: recall-gate tokens and once-per-session remember markers
# written by .claude/hooks/hippius-mem-*.sh. Per-machine, never shared.
.hippius-mem/
# Subagent-driven-development scratch: per-plan ledgers, task briefs, reports,
# and review packages. Local coordination state, never part of the source tree.
.superpowers/
# cargo-mutants run output (outcomes.json, missed/caught/timeout lists, per-mutant
# build and test logs). Written into the repo root by a local `cargo mutants`;
# the nightly job uploads it as a run artifact instead.
/mutants.out/
# lcov report written by `cargo llvm-cov report --lcov --output-path lcov.info`.
# Regenerated from the profile data; never commit it.
/lcov.info
# Diagnostic dump written by tests/mcp_protocol.rs's snapshot test on a
# mismatch, so the failure has a reviewable file to diff instead of only an
# escaped single-line assertion message. Never the committed reference itself.
/hippius-mem/tests/snapshots/*.actual
